Subject: [PATCH 4/6] test(05-03): failing tests for the split-safe citation
 marker parser

Stub parser reports nothing so the tests fail on assertions. Covers every
single and pair split, random chunking against a grammar oracle, per-text-id
isolation, and bounded-time adversarial input.

